{"v":1,"id":"d105ca30a3bb","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"The morning dove rests peacefully","s":14.53,"e":18.12},{"t":"Beside the pecan tree","s":18.21,"e":21.8},{"t":"Cooing sweet and softly","s":21.83,"e":25.43},{"t":"Nature’s sunrise choir","s":25.51,"e":29.05},{"t":"Gentle sounds are echoing","s":29.08,"e":31.87},{"t":"Throughout the universe","s":31.94,"e":35.04},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom","s":35.09,"e":38.58},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom","s":38.63,"e":43.35},{"t":"Calling to its Creator","s":43.4,"e":46.71},{"t":"As each line is rehearsed","s":46.79,"e":51.09},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom, the dove calls out","s":51.1,"e":58.79},{"t":"In Sabbath peace and light","s":58.87,"e":65.38},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom, a gift of rest","s":65.43,"e":73.31},{"t":"That holds us through the night","s":73.38,"e":81.58},{"t":"The morning dove has wings","s":81.59,"e":83.85},{"t":"So beautiful and white","s":84.07,"e":87.46},{"t":"When soaring toward the sun","s":87.55,"e":90.17},{"t":"You behold God’s awesome light","s":90.25,"e":94.13},{"t":"So radiant in beauty","s":94.2,"e":98.37},{"t":"Dazzling and bright","s":98.65,"e":101.49},{"t":"No words can quite describe it","s":101.69,"e":104.82},{"t":"As the dove takes flight","s":105.0,"e":108.12},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom, the dove calls out","s":108.13,"e":115.71},{"t":"In Sabbath peace and light","s":115.93,"e":122.19},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom, a gift of rest","s":122.24,"e":129.87},{"t":"That holds us through the night","s":129.98,"e":138.23},{"t":"It praises its Creator","s":138.25,"e":140.71},{"t":"And coos Shabbat Shalom","s":140.79,"e":145.27},{"t":"The Sabbath peace He gave us","s":145.33,"e":148.0},{"t":"A rest that leads us home","s":148.17,"e":157.69},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom, the dove calls out","s":157.7,"e":165.32},{"t":"In Sabbath peace and light","s":165.56,"e":171.85},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom, the rest He gives","s":171.91,"e":179.42},{"t":"Will never cease in flight","s":179.57,"e":185.99},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom","s":186.03,"e":192.99},{"t":"Shabbat Shalom","s":193.49,"e":194.49}],"match":null}
